#: crates/tagjoe-gui/src/settings.rs:402 crates/tagjoe-gui/src/view.rs:471
msgid "Installed:"
msgstr "Installiert:"

#: crates/tagjoe-gui/src/settings.rs:402
msgid ""
"The check asks GitHub at most once a day for the latest release of this "
"repository and sends your IP address and the program id. Nothing is "
"downloaded without your confirmation; a package is verified against "
"SHA256SUMS of the same release."
msgstr ""
"Die Prüfung fragt höchstens einmal täglich bei GitHub nach dem neuesten "
"Release dieses Repositorys und übermittelt dabei deine IP-Adresse und die "
